private volatile boolean running = true;

public void run() {
    while (running) {        // checked each loop iteration
        processNextOrder();
    }
}

public void shutdown() {
    running = false;          // ask the thread to stop
    worker.interrupt();       // wake it if it is sleeping or waiting
}
```
*The worker exits cleanly at the next check, so shared state is never left corrupted.*

